Ask the user for each value. Do not invent one, and do not write one into `.mcp.json`, because that
file belongs to the project and goes into version control. Put the name of the variable in the file,
and keep the value in the environment.

The server starts and lists its tools with no value set. A key is needed only when the model
calls a tool, so a failure at startup is never a missing key.
